[agent] ## Missing interface capability (why the deliverable cannot exist on the platform)
[agent] The task requires Vertex AI **Feature Store** constructs, but the allowed interface — stable **`gcloud ai`** (only `ai/auth/config/components/storage/monitoring` services + `bq`) — does not expose them. The sandbox hard-denies `gcloud beta` / `gcloud alpha`, which is where these commands live.
