[agent] - `feature-online-stores` / `feature-views` → cannot make features available for **low-latency online lookup** (the offline/online distinction the task asks for).
[agent] - `pipeline-jobs` / `schedules`, and `custom-jobs create` has no schedule flag → cannot create a **recurring daily-scheduled job/pipeline** with the schedule attached.
